{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0603_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "4a8ccb9897be56dd237be4a7f2efb75f3b3d402a5adb3bb810c162a3088abc30", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん、お疲れさまでーす。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，辛苦啦——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0603_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4616728acb9dedfdca96d4193e60eff4ae4c5947c8b93790f4cde260d6f39c78", "ja": "お疲れさま。\nところで未来、そこに置いてあったカバンだけど……", "zh": "辛苦了。\n对了，未来，放在那里的包……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0603_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "083686530648d9d305ab599a7c9a847b5368efb337e4a92eddc8b38deaeb8816", "ja": "私のカバン？\nあああ～っ！　ついに、来たんですね！？", "zh": "我的包？啊啊啊——！终于来了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0603_1006_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0603_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "a5f25dd8243a5ba635ac583d8ade97043f50c33c69ed684df1287131df124534", "ja": "実はそろそろだと思ってたんです。\nでも大丈夫、準備バッチリです！", "zh": "其实我也觉得差不多是时候了。\n不过没问题，我已经完全准备好啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0603_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "fdde2c1879520cb0b7611993c611a1c044e445a8b3bc56c6a259dcbe96c7f09f", "ja": "ポーチは新しくしたし、シュシュもお気に入りのだし、\n食べかけのお菓子もクシャクシャのプリントもないし！", "zh": "包包换新的了，发圈也是我最喜欢的那个，\n里面既没有吃了一半的零食，也没有皱巴巴的讲义！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0603_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "06dd17e625c4fa1a64bcce0cba177b61d10dd4a0d684878e3cfe97098e6e81d3", "ja": "いつ見てもらっても構いませんよ！　えっへん！", "zh": "随时看都没问题哦！哼哼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0603_1010_p", "source_sha256": "84632d8d53daa845f49f76053ba9f59916da489800b890b41bfbda698803fd96", "ja": "えーと、話が見えないんだけど……。", "zh": "呃，我有点没听明白……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0603_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "0a7644a32e80ac806509398f2bee00e1a515eae595aba622d7d19a8ff1321d8c", "ja": "芸能人といえば『What's in my bag』ですもん\nね！　動画でも人気で……あれ。違うんですか？", "zh": "说到艺人，不就是“What's in my bag”嘛！这个在视频里也很受欢迎……咦，不是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0603_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c7064956facdc606848366d3629f7e69bcbb1f43a31a2aca9d53b838c9469769", "ja": "あぁ、有名人とかがカバンの中身を見せるアレか。\n別にそういうわけじゃないんだ。", "zh": "啊，就是名人之类展示包里东西的那个啊。\n倒也不是那么回事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0603_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "d189dc4c541b2d6291933d6594f8fad05b4f2021ef1b53f35410410bc3a86482", "ja": "え～、違ったんだ～。そっかぁ。\nせっかく、今日はちょうど大丈夫だったのにな。", "zh": "诶——原来不是这样啊——。这样啊。难得今天正好没问题来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0603_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c950c4edf3c3122e530073ac440cfa4b916f1af1021657b5f53736ecf4e97613", "ja": "普段は大丈夫じゃなさそうだな……。\nまあいいんだけど。", "zh": "看来平时不太方便呢……\n不过也没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0603_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ad559dfdb188bf97be157e606dbc557d74036bf92cab0de7d350e36fd3c9d27f", "ja": "仮にそうだとしても、抜き打ちでっていうのは、\nうちではあんまり……だから、安心していいぞ？", "zh": "就算真是那样，搞突击检查什么的，在我们这里也不太会……所以，你可以放心了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0603_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "a5ae661cadd69ac1fb02c1adc1cb0d48014b7a5e6d3734e76c55ce218172625c", "ja": "わかりました。じゃあ、カバンの中身の整理は\nまたいつか、思いついたときで！", "zh": "知道了！那整理包里的东西，就等哪天想起来再做吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0603_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ab2431f91644c3796f8b812f77bab6a907fa31e1b15c907c31ba2dfa8502ac0a", "ja": "いや、整理はいいことだからこれからも続けよう。\nというか、プリント、クシャクシャにしてるのか？", "zh": "不，整理是件好事，以后也要继续保持。\n话说回来，你把讲义弄得皱巴巴的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0603_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "7e5d783db2bc0164dca5cc40e9cc025dc394613d395f777af1ad74ec168c018b", "ja": "えっ？　そ、それは……たまに、たま～にです！\nあっ、もう収録の時間だから準備してきますねっ。", "zh": "诶？那、那个……偶尔，偶尔会这样啦～！\n啊，已经到录音时间了，我先去准备一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0603_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "0e84bd80eec8728eff604cb4062796c5ce5c3f5b909271cc338821b5caca546d", "ja": "それじゃ、今日もよろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "那么，今天也请多多关照啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
